[0.000, "o", "LAST DEPLOYED: Thu Oct  1 03:58:19 2026\r\nNAMESPACE: ops-demo\r\nSTATUS: deployed\r\nREVISION: 6\r\nDESCRIPTION: Upgrade complete\r\nNOTES:\r\nRelease notes (api 1.1.0, chart 0.1.0) is installed in namespace ops-demo.\r\n\r\nThis is a portfolio/demo chart, not a production product.\r\n\r\nCheck status:\r\n  kubectl -n ops-demo get pods -l app.kubernetes.io/instance=notes\r\n  helm -n ops-demo test notes\r\n\r\nTalk to the API:\r\n  kubectl -n ops-demo port-forward svc/notes-api 8080:8080\r\n  curl -s localhost:8080/version\r\n  curl -s -XPOST --data 'hello' localhost:8080/notes\r\n\r\nBackups: CronJob notes-backup (\"17 */6 * * *\"), keeping 14 dumps, plus a pre-upgrade/pre-rollback hook backup.\r\nRun one now:\r\n  kubectl -n ops-demo create job --from=cronjob/notes-backup manual-backup-$(date +%s)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
